BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-09-26T01:00:00&endDate=2026-09-28T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nPICCADILLY LINE: From 0200 Saturday 26 and all day Sunday 27 September (including Friday and Saturday Night Tube)\, no service between Cockfosters and Uxbridge. Trains continue to operate between Acton Town and Heathrow. Use DISTRICT LINE trains between Central London and Acton Town / Ealing Common and METROPOLITAN LINE trains between Rayners Lane and Uxbridge. Use ELIZABETH LINE trains for travel between Central London and Heathrow. Replacement buses operate.
DTEND:20260928T002900Z
DTSTART:20260926T010000Z
SUMMARY:Piccadilly: Part Closure
UID:20c35a9e-512d-4969-94ec-aa4a01551e1a@20c3.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
